<title>UK: Bank Leu sets warrants on Nestle S.A..</title>
<headline>Bank Leu sets warrants on Nestle S.A..</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bank Leu (Zurich) said it has issued three  million American-style call warrants, on Nestle registered shares.</p>
<p>One share is controlled by 20 warrants.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    1400 CHF		 ISSUE PRICE   6.40 CHF</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 28.OCT.96-15.APR.98   PAYDATE	25.OCT.96</p>
<p> LISTING APPLIED-SWISS EXCHANGE	  MIN EXER LOT 20</p>
<p>-- Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
